<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Aluminium sees Oct-March sales up yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Aluminium sees Oct-March sales up yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Aluminium Co said it expects sales of flat-rolled and extruded aluminium products to total 13,450 tonnes per month in the half-year to March 1997, up 5.2 percent from the same period a year ago but off 0.4 percent from the April-September period of this year.</p>
<p>It planned sales of flat-rolled products at 11,050 tonnes, up 7.2 percent year-on-year, while extruded product sales were seen at 2,400 tonnes, down 3.2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3 3432 6179</p>
